# ex:IOC_SuspiciousPayload cs:indicatesThreat ex:T001 .
# ex:IOC_DataExfil cs:indicatesThreat ex:T010 .

ex:IOC_SuspiciousLogin cs:indicatesThreat cs:BruteForceAttack .
ex:IOC_MaliciousURL cs:indicatesThreat cs:PhishingAttack .
ex:IOC_UnusualTraffic cs:indicatesThreat cs:DDoSAttack .
ex:IOC_SuspiciousPayload cs:indicatesThreat cs:Malware .
ex:IOC_DataExfil cs:indicatesThreat cs:Spyware .